  "rawText": "INTRODUCTION and ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS\n\nWe wish to thank all of you for your enthusiastic\nsupport of our efforts to make this Francis Family reunion\na memorable one. You accepted the project of compiling\na Family Album as an endeavor of value, and your cooperation\nmade us eager to put together a booklet that you would\nbe proud of. We hope that we have succeeded.\n\nWe thank you also for your time, your attention\nto detail, your suggestions, your offers of assistance,\nand your Sharing of your skills and talents. We are\nespecially thankful to those whose UNIQUE CONTRIBUTIONS\nmade this album and this reunion a reality:\n\nMattie Francis Carlyle Sally: C...Francis\nJesse A. Francis © Renee D. Francis\nDennis A. Copeland Exdine F. Eatmon\nJacqueline F. Parker - Patricia Williams\nYvonne F. Samuels Douglass C. Summers\n\nDoris F. Kinard\n\nThis Francis Family Album is dedicated, in loving\nmemory, to the values, hard work, and individual attri-\nbutes of James Henry and Pearl Clanton Francis. The\npurpose of compiling this album is threefold: (1) to in-\ntroduce younger.family members to a brief family history,\n(2) to enable the family members to get to know one another\nmoxe intimately, and (3) to inspire and motivate the youngest\nfamily members through positive examples.\n\nWe hope this Album fudfills its purpose; and that\n\nit will become a cherished document worthy of the people\nwho have contributed to it.\n\nTHE REUNION COMMITTEE\nEleanor P. Francis\nJoan Francis Summers\n\nDoris Louise (Farrow) Francis",
  "cleanedText": "INTRODUCTION and ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS\n\nWe wish to thank all of you for your enthusiastic\nsupport of our efforts to make this Francis Family reunion\na memorable one. You accepted the project of compiling\na Family Album as an endeavor of value, and your cooperation\nmade us eager to put together a booklet that you would\nbe proud of. We hope that we have succeeded.\n\nWe thank you also for your time, your attention\nto detail, your suggestions, your offers of assistance,\nand your Sharing of your skills and talents. We are\nespecially thankful to those whose UNIQUE CONTRIBUTIONS\nmade this album and this reunion a reality:\n\nMattie Francis Carlyle Sally: C...Francis\nJesse A. Francis © Renee D. Francis\nDennis A. Copeland Exdine F. Eatmon\nJacqueline F. Parker - Patricia Williams\nYvonne F. Samuels Douglass C. Summers\n\nDoris F. Kinard\n\nThis Francis Family Album is dedicated, in loving\nmemory, to the values, hard work, and individual attri-\nbutes of James Henry and Pearl Clanton Francis. The\npurpose of compiling this album is threefold: (1) to in-\ntroduce younger.family members to a brief family history,\n(2) to enable the family members to get to know one another\nmoxe intimately, and (3) to inspire and motivate the youngest\nfamily members through positive examples.\n\nWe hope this Album fudfills its purpose; and that\n\nit will become a cherished document worthy of the people\nwho have contributed to it.\n\nTHE REUNION COMMITTEE\nEleanor P. Francis\nJoan Francis Summers\n\nDoris Louise (Farrow) Francis",
